<title>CROATIA: Croatia July RPI down 0.3 pct m/m, up 2.7 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatia July RPI down 0.3 pct m/m, up 2.7 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL PRICES	   JULY	  JUNE	JULY 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month (pct)	    -0.3	  +0.2	  +0.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year			+2.7	  +3.4	  +4.3 NOTE</p>
<p>-- January-July retail price inflation was put at 3.7 percent compared  to the same period of 1996. -- Zagreb newsroom + 385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
